GC_LobbyGameMode : "{A79C4E0A43DEB821}Prefabs/MP/Modes/GC_LobbyGameMode.et" {
 ID "5E13B342F5536A14"
 components {
  GC_LobbyManager "{6A137A39106A4973}" {
   m_aBriefings {
    GC_Briefing "{51752F914CDF0203}" {
     m_iOrder 0
     m_sTitle "I. Situation:"
     m_sContent "<h2>I. Situation:</h2>"\
     "<b>Time & Weather:</b>"\
     "Time - 20:42 (Sunset)"\
     "Weather - Cloudy with light fog."\
     ""\
     "<b>Situation:</b>"\
     "A Soviet VDV Company has just been dropped off south of Nova Olesov by a Mi-8 Squadron and moved up to the cover of a riverbed. Preparing to conduct a assault onto the town itself imminently which is being defended by a Motorized Canadian Company (+)"
    }
    GC_Briefing "{A56AEC12F84E08B3}" {
     m_iOrder 1
     m_sTitle "A. Enemy Forces:"
     m_sContent "<h2>A. Enemy Forces:</h2>"\
     "<b>Equipment:</b>"\
     "USSR are equipped with their standard WARSAW Pact weaponry, AK series, RPG7s, RPKs."\
     "Wearing the standard USSR uniform of VDV Camo with greenish helmet."\
     ""\
     "<b>Known Strength:</b>"\
     "1x VDV Company"\
     "2x Mi-24s"\
     "3x Mi-8s"\
     ""\
     "<b>Location: </b>"\
     "Last known location at 083 056"\
     ""\
     "<b>Capabilities:</b>"\
     "Access to RPKs, RPGs."\
     "Vehicles include Mi-8s & Mi-24s"\
     ""\
     "<b>MLCOA:</b>"\
     "Land and secure one of the infrastructures (Military Base, Industry, Hangers), before pushing outwards securing the rest."\
     ""\
     "<b>MDCOA:</b>"\
     "Land and secure one of the infrastructures (Military Base, Industry, Hangers), utilizing the Mi-24 to sweep the forests with rockets, before continuing to secure the rest of the Air field."\
     ""\
     "<b>Defensive Fires:</b>"\
     "No known threat at this time."\
     ""\
     "<b>Airthreat:</b>"\
     "Mi-24s and Mi-8s"\
     ""\
     "<b>Morale:</b>"\
     "VERY High."\
     ""\
     "<b>CBRN Threat:</b>"\
     "The enemy pose no CBRN Threat."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_CAF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{C05EC52BB61B010F}" {
     m_iOrder 2
     m_sTitle "A. Enemy Forces:"
     m_sContent "<h2>A. Enemy Forces:</h2>"\
     "<b>Equipment:</b>"\
     "CAF are equipped with their standard NATO weaponry, M16A1s series, LAWs/M67s, M249s, M60, etc.."\
     "Wearing woodland coloured camo uniforms & helmets."\
     ""\
     "<b>Known Strength:</b>"\
     "1x Rifle Company (++)"\
     ""\
     "<b>Location:</b>"\
     "Throughout Nova Olesov, likely in preparing for our attack as they shot down 2x of our Mi-8s during their egress east."\
     ""\
     "<b>Capabilities:</b>"\
     "LAV-25s"\
     ""\
     "<b>MLCOA:</b>"\
     "Prepare for our attack, engage us before either pulling back or send more forces to us."\
     ""\
     "<b>MDCOA:</b>"\
     "Be ready for our attack, have forward recon to spot us before sending in squads to push us back with the help of LAV25s"\
     ""\
     "<b>Defensive Fires:</b>"\
     "No known threat at this time."\
     ""\
     "<b>Airthreat:</b>"\
     "None."\
     ""\
     "<b>Morale:</b>"\
     "Very High."\
     ""\
     "<b>CBRN Threat:</b>"\
     "The enemy pose no CBRN Threat."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "USSR"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{84838FFCC2511EEF}" {
     m_iOrder 3
     m_sTitle "B. Friendly Forces:"
     m_sContent "<h2>B. Friendly Forces</h2>"\
     "<b>a. Disposition:</b>"\
     "Our Battalion (-) is located on the Airfield, we're fairly spread out and we don't know where all our fellow Platoons are located, but we have some clue."\
     ""\
     "<b>b. Higher Units Mission:</b>"\
     "Battalion has been assigned as security detail for the Air field while we prepare for the inevitable invasion."\
     ""\
     "<b>c. Composition:</b>"\
     "1x Platoon (-) (Players)"\
     ""\
     "<b>d. Strength:</b>"\
     "1st Platoon - At 6x Man Strength"\
     ""\
     "<b>e. Supporting Fires:</b>"\
     "None."\
     ""\
     "<b>f. Attachments/Detachments:</b>"\
     "None."\
     ""\
     "<b>g. Additional Ammunition</b>"\
     "FIM Stingers"
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_CAF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{42A4FD5FAFD9B439}" {
     m_iOrder 4
     m_sTitle "B. Friendly Forces:"
     m_sContent "<h2>B. Friendly Forces</h2>"\
     "<b>a. Disposition:</b>"\
     "All VDV Forces (YOU) are located at 070 068"\
     ""\
     "<b>b. Higher Units Mission:</b>"\
     "Company has been tasked with securing the southern half of Nova Olesov by taking control of the Canadian Company HQ's Compound."\
     ""\
     "<b>c. Composition:</b>"\
     "1x VDV Company"\
     ""\
     "<b>d. Strength:</b>"\
     "340 - At 3x Man Strength."\
     "341 - At 21x Man Strength."\
     "344 - At 21x Man Strength."\
     "347 - At 21x Man Strength."\
     ""\
     "<b>e. Supporting Fires:</b>"\
     "None."\
     ""\
     "<b>f. Attachments/Detachments:</b>"\
     "None."\
     ""\
     "<b>g. Additional Ammunition</b>"\
     "None."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "USSR"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{197E2C2FD080CBDB}" {
     m_iOrder 5
     m_sTitle "II. Mission (Must Read):"
     m_sContent "<h2>II: Mission</h2>"\
     "Prevent the loss of our critical Infrastructures.. if they are lost to the enemy we have no choice but to fall back."\
     ""\
     "15x Respawns at start and no more."\
     ""\
     "<b>We also have 4x FIM92 Stingers sitting in a Crate outside near the HMMWVs.. Recommend to focus them on the Mi-24s (Please do not use them against Mi-8 until all MI-24s are dead OR until they've at least completed their first landing. Mission Maker Intent</b>"\
     ""\
     "Adjacent Units (AI) will spawn upon the arrival of VDV Forces."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_CAF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{AE81589E80E55BD3}" {
     m_iOrder 6
     m_sTitle "II. Mission (Must Read):"
     m_sContent "<h2>II: Mission</h2>"\
     "Push through and secure the compound holding the Canadian Company HQ located in the town of Nova Olesov at grid 072 079"
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "USSR"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{A06D48B3A6BD7646}" {
     m_iOrder 7
     m_sTitle "III. Execution:"
     m_sContent "<h2>III: Execution</h2>"\
     "<b>Intent:</b>"\
     "Protect our South and North Infrastructures if they are lost to the enemy we have to fall back from the Airfield to Kamoryn."\
     ""\
     "<b>1. Concept of the Operation:</b>"\
     "Platoon Commander's Discretion."\
     "It is advised to utilize our fellow comrades (AI) to locate the enemy and hit them before we have to pull back.. Also to shoot down the Mi-24s"\
     ""\
     "<b>2. Maneuver</b>"\
     "Platoon Commander's Discretion."\
     "It is advised to not split up the squads too much or too far ahead so they can mutually support one another if needed."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_CAF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{ED37591131EEF050}" {
     m_iOrder 8
     m_sTitle "III. Execution:"
     m_sContent "<h2>III: Execution</h2>"\
     "<b>Intent:</b>"\
     "Push through any defences and secure the south half of the town."\
     ""\
     "<b>1. Concept of the Operation:</b>"\
     "Company Commander's Discretion."\
     "It is advised to use the infantry to locate easy access across the terrain and move the company through it together."\
     ""\
     "<b>2. Maneuver</b>"\
     "Company Commander's Discretion."\
     "It is advised to not seperate platoons from eachother, but allow them to stay close so they can mutually support one another and fight as a company whole."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "USSR"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{307CA882B79F82E7}" {
     m_iOrder 9
     m_sTitle "IV. Sustainment:"
     m_sContent "<h2>IV: Sustainment</h2>"\
     "<b>a. SOP Variations</b>"\
     "Dress: Standard Canadian Uniform"\
     "Equipment: Standard Canadian Loadout"\
     ""\
     "<b>b. Logistical Support:</b>"\
     "Replen Plan: None for 24h."\
     "Ammunition: Each man carries his own ammunition."\
     "IPE: Helmets and body armour are to be worn at all times."\
     ""\
     "Crate outside contains:"\
     "- 4x FIM92 Stingers"\
     "- 50x Flares Green"\
     "- 50x Flares Orange"\
     "- 50x Flares White"\
     ""\
     "Each HMMWV Contains:"\
     "300x Sandbags"\
     ""\
     "<b>c. Medical:</b>"\
     "Location: Company Aid Post is to be setup by platoon medic."\
     "CASEVAC: By foot or with Platoon Assets like HMMWVs"\
     "Plan: Set up a casualty collection point and extract casualties to this point."\
     "Stretchers: None"\
     "Med Packs: Platoon medpack carried by platoon medic."\
     "Morphine: Every soldier carries 1+ stick of morphine."\
     ""\
     "<b>d. Vehicles:</b>"\
     "2x HMMWV M2s"\
     "2x HMMWVs"
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_CAF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{B002582F4066C499}" {
     m_iOrder 10
     m_sTitle "IV. Sustainment:"
     m_sContent "<h2>IV: Sustainment</h2>"\
     "<b>a. SOP Variations</b>"\
     "Dress: Standard Soviet Uniform"\
     "Equipment: Standard Soviet Loadout"\
     ""\
     "<b>b. Logistical Support:</b>"\
     "Replen Plan: None for 24h."\
     "Ammunition: Each man carries his own ammunition."\
     "IPE: Helmets and body armour are to be worn at all times."\
     ""\
     "A crashed Mi-8 near Company HQ contains:"\
     "- 20x Bandages"\
     "- 200x 30rnd AK Mags"\
     "- 50x 30rnd AK Tracer Mags"\
     "- 75x 45rnd RPK Mags"\
     "- 40x 45rnd RPK Tracer Mags"\
     ""\
     "NOTE: FIRE IS COSMETIC AT MI-8"\
     "NOTE: FIRE IS COSMETIC AT MI-8"\
     ""\
     "(Yes I wrote it twice, it stands out)"\
     ""\
     "<b>c. Medical:</b>"\
     "Location: Company Aid Post is to be setup by platoon medic."\
     "CASEVAC: By foot or with company asset like Mi-8 or even Mi-24 if there are any."\
     "Plan: Set up a casualty collection point and extract casualties to this point."\
     "Stretchers: None"\
     "Med Packs: Platoon medpack carried by platoon medic."\
     "Morphine: Every soldier carries 1+ stick of morphine."\
     ""\
     "<b>d. Vehicles:</b>"\
     "None."\
     ""\
     "<b>No Helicopter Rearming Available.</b>"
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "USSR"
     }
    }
